ssage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-huanwen:p004:m0148","start":148,"end":149,"surface":"福","kind":"person","person_id":"4ys_87g_ilk","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-098-huanwen:p004","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-huanwen"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-huanwen:p004:m0163","start":163,"end":164,"surface":"福","kind":"person","person_id":"4ys_87g_ilk","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-098-huanwen:p004","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-huanwen"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-huanwen:p004","text":"時李勢微弱，溫志在立勳於蜀，永和二年，率眾西伐。時康獻太后臨朝，溫將發，上疏而行。朝廷以蜀險遠，而溫兵寡少，深入敵場，甚以為憂。初，諸葛亮造八陣圖于魚復平沙之上，壘石為八行，行相去二丈。溫見之，謂「此常山蛇勢也。」文武皆莫能識之。及軍次彭模，乃命參軍周楚、孫盛守輜重，自將步卒直指成都。勢使其叔父福及從兄權等攻彭模，楚等禦之，福退走。溫又擊權等，三戰三捷，賊眾散，自間道歸成都。勢於是悉眾與溫戰於笮橋，參軍龔護戰沒，眾懼欲退，而鼓吏誤鳴進鼓，於是攻之，勢眾大潰。溫乘勝直進，焚其小城，勢遂夜遁九十里，至晉壽葭萌城，其將鄧嵩、昝堅勸勢降，乃面縛輿櫬請命。溫解縛焚櫬，送于京師。溫停蜀三旬，舉賢旌善，偽尚書僕射王誓、中書監王瑜、鎮東將軍鄧定、散騎常侍常璩等，皆蜀之良也，並以為參軍，百姓咸悅。軍未旋而王誓、鄧定、隗文等反，溫復討平之。振旅還江陵，進位征西大將軍、開府，封臨賀郡公。","source_position":{"kind":"wikitext_codepoint_positions","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-2614273-raw.wikitext","raw_start":8582,"raw_end":8977,"character_positions":[8582,8583,8584,8585,8586,8587,8588,8589,8590,8591,8592,